                                        "entry_id": "be443869-dcd8-3ca7-af32-dc1367c282ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The fact of being restored to cordial relations with each other; settling differences, making peace; reconciliation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8a5c0a5-c79e-4629-96a7-050a1e064132",
                                                "sense_id": "a3d91fea-b4a7-308e-841d-1802c77f5620",
                                                "text": "Thus reconcilement was betweene them knitt, Through goodly temperaunce and affection chaste [...]."
